      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing an unbearable level of exhaustion, and the feeling of things dissolving is terrifying. The ache you feel is real, and you deserve genuine peace without having to make a final sacrifice for it. Please know that there are ways to find respite and lightness without ending your journey. I urge you again to reach out to 988; they are trained to see the soul beneath the struggle.",
